    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Your Path's Surge generation learns a second voice.</em></p><p>At <strong>Bulwark Initiation 11</strong>, apply the rule for your chosen Path:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Path of the Avalanche.</strong> Bank <strong>+1 Surge</strong> when you land a melee strike whose dice show an 8 or higher before explosions. Once per round.</p></li><li><p><strong>Path of the Mountain.</strong> Your eat-the-blow cap rises from +2 to <strong>+3 Surge a round</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Path of the Cataclyst.</strong> When you make a defensive and an offensive Surge spend in the same round, in either order, bank <strong>+1 Surge</strong>. Once per round.</p></li></ul>",
